# Packaging: the vendored better-sqlite3 IS committed (trimmed to the JS lib
# + platform prebuilds, PREBUILDS.md documents provenance). It MUST be in
# the repo for the Windows CI build — the CI checkout never runs npm's
# postinstall for the vendored copy, and tauri.conf.json maps it into the
# bundle resources (DC-24 §4.4). Trimming rule: deps/ (the sqlite3 C source
# for local rebuilds) stays out of git; both .node prebuilds stay in.
src-tauri/resources/better-sqlite3/deps/


# Internal-only material (QA logs, reviews, handoffs, agent instructions,
# owner comms). NEVER pushed to GitHub.
internal/
# CI-only: real node.exe is downloaded by windows-release.yml; local placeholder
# is zero-byte and MUST NOT be bundled (Linux builds use system node).
src-tauri/resources/runtime-node/
